      "statement": "The boards table carries an automerge flag (INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0, part of the single 0001 schema migration) that lets the dispatcher auto-merge an approved PR; repositories are first-class peers linked one-to-many via board_repositories, so boards no longer carry a single repository git_url.",
