    {
      "id": "claim_8db922c8c32840b8b0b37d18cede4602",
      "statement": "Self-healing autonomous recovery: when a non-orchestrator worker exhausts the worker_failure_retries budget (or its process vanishes), the reaper routes the task to todo with triage_phase='recovery' for exactly one diagnostic attempt by zf-orchestrator (gated on orchestrator_recovery_count < 1); a second exhaustion, or any exhaustion of the orchestrator itself, parks the task in blocked with blocked_reason_type='stuck' and permanently_blocked for a human.",
