    {
      "id": "claim_6702bafdb0324bbaade8b49fc42ef926",
      "statement": "Periodic automation is materialized as built-in cron jobs — 15-minute task-queue watchdog + dispatch cycle (core), daily activity stats (core), one improvement scanner per board (scanner, idle-triggered with per-board cooldown/max-todo config, disabled by default), and one OpenWiki doc-sync per board (openwiki) — listed, toggled, updated, reset, and triggered through dashboard/routes/cron.py persisting settings keys cron_enabled_<job_id> and scan_on_idle_<slug>; the standalone cron/ package and the zf_queue_watchdog.py / zf_scanner_gate.py scripts were removed, leaving only the No-Agent Mode scripts zf_openwiki_gate.py and zf_daily_stats.py.",
